---
title: "record_attendance_by_card (20260317 Migration: Add display_name and RPC)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_lookup_user: SELECT supabase_auth_user_id FROM attendance.users WHERE card_id = p_card_id
    q_lookup_user --> q_check_user: v_user_id assigned
    q_check_user --> q_return_not_found: v_user_id IS NULL
    q_return_not_found --> [*]: return json(success=false, message=unregistered card)

    q_check_user --> q_get_member: v_user_id IS NOT NULL
    q_get_member --> q_check_display_name: SELECT display_name, discord_uid FROM member.members WHERE supabase_auth_user_id = v_user_id

    q_check_display_name --> q_fallback_global_name: v_display_name IS NULL
    q_fallback_global_name --> q_get_last_type: SELECT global_name FROM auth.users WHERE id = v_user_id

    q_check_display_name --> q_get_last_type: v_display_name IS NOT NULL

    q_get_last_type --> q_decide_type: SELECT type FROM attendance.attendances WHERE user_id = v_user_id ORDER BY timestamp DESC LIMIT 1

    q_decide_type --> q_set_out: v_last_type = 'in'
    q_set_out --> q_insert: v_new_type = 'out'

    q_decide_type --> q_set_in: v_last_type != 'in' OR v_last_type IS NULL
    q_set_in --> q_insert: v_new_type = 'in'

    q_insert --> q_return_success: INSERT INTO attendance.attendances(user_id, card_id, type, timestamp, date)
    q_return_success --> [*]: return json(success=true, user, type)

    q_insert --> q_exception: EXCEPTION WHEN OTHERS
    q_exception --> [*]: return json(success=false, message=error SQLERRM)

    note right of q_lookup_user
        INV-001: p_card_id must map to at most one user (card_id is unique key)
        INV-002: SECURITY DEFINER executes with function owner privileges, not caller
        INV-003: search_path restricted to attendance, member schemas
    end note

    note right of q_decide_type
        INV-004: Toggle logic - if last record is 'in' then new is 'out', otherwise 'in'
        INV-005: First attendance for a user defaults to 'in' (v_last_type IS NULL case)
    end note

    note right of q_insert
        INV-006: v_date derived from v_now AT TIME ZONE Asia/Tokyo, ensuring JST date
        INV-007: timestamp and date are consistent (date = date portion of timestamp in JST)
        INV-008: All exceptions caught and returned as JSON error, never raised to caller
    end note
